<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>水晶療癒 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%99%82%E7%99%92/</link><description>Recent content in 水晶療癒 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%99%82%E7%99%92/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>水瓶座守護水晶：月光石與紫水晶的搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水瓶座常見守護石是&lt;strong&gt;月光石&lt;/strong&gt;，輔助可選紫水晶與天青石。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>白水晶功效與淨化：石英入門保養指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%8B%B1%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%8B%B1%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;白水晶（Clear Quartz）是無色透明至乳白色的石英。&lt;/strong&gt;「放大能量」「淨化」是水晶文化中的象徵說法，與物理清潔是兩件事。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>金牛座守護水晶：綠髮碧璽與綠幽靈怎麼選</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%B6%A0%E9%AB%AE%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E8%88%87%E7%B6%A0%E5%B9%BD%E9%9D%88%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%B6%A0%E9%AB%AE%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E8%88%87%E7%B6%A0%E5%B9%BD%E9%9D%88%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;金牛座常見守護石是&lt;strong&gt;綠髮碧璽&lt;/strong&gt;，輔助可選綠幽靈與粉晶。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>射手座守護水晶：紫水晶與綠松石怎麼選</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B6%A0%E6%9D%BE%E7%9F%B3%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B6%A0%E6%9D%BE%E7%9F%B3%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;射手座常見守護石是&lt;strong&gt;紫水晶&lt;/strong&gt;，輔助可選綠松石與天河石。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>黃水晶功效：左右手、五行與選購保養指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%83%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%B7%A6%E5%8F%B3%E6%89%8B%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%87%E9%81%B8%E8%B3%BC%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%83%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%B7%A6%E5%8F%B3%E6%89%8B%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%87%E9%81%B8%E8%B3%BC%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;黃水晶（Citrine）是黃色至橘色的石英。&lt;/strong&gt;「招財」「提升自信」是水晶文化中的象徵，沒有證據保證佩戴後財運或健康會改變。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>黑曜石功效與禁忌：火山玻璃的使用指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E6%9B%9C%E7%9F%B3%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E7%A6%81%E5%BF%8C%E7%81%AB%E5%B1%B1%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E6%9B%9C%E7%9F%B3%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E7%A6%81%E5%BF%8C%E7%81%AB%E5%B1%B1%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;黑曜石（Obsidian）是天然火山玻璃。&lt;/strong&gt;「擋煞」「防護」是文化與個人儀式中的說法，不能當成可驗證的物理或醫療功效。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>雙魚座守護水晶：螢石與紫水晶的選擇</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%9E%A2%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%9E%A2%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;雙魚座常見守護石是&lt;strong&gt;螢石&lt;/strong&gt;，輔助可選紫水晶與海藍寶。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪守護水晶速查表：每個脈輪該配什麼石頭最有感</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶療癒這幾年很紅——但很多人買了一堆水晶，卻不知道&lt;strong&gt;哪個對應哪個脈輪&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;該怎麼搭配&lt;/strong&gt;。買到對的水晶，能感覺能量明顯改變；買到不對的或亂配，效果就只是「漂亮」。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>天秤座守護水晶完整指南：葡萄石與青金石的能量搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E9%9D%92%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E9%9D%92%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;天秤座的人生，是一場永恆的秤量——這邊多一點好呢，還是那邊多一點？這個選擇更對呢，還是那個？當所有人都在往前衝的時候，天秤座站在十字路口，認真地想要找到那個最公平、最美好、最不傷害任何人的答案。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>獅子座守護石是什麼？金髮晶、太陽石怎麼搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;獅子座守護石是什麼？本站以金髮晶為主石，太陽石為輔助石，對應自信與溫暖的文化意象。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>黑碧璽功效完整解析：最強大地守護石</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E7%9F%B3/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E7%9F%B3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果水晶世界裡有一位沉默的守門人，那一定是黑碧璽。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;它不像&lt;a href="https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/"&gt;紫水晶&lt;/a&gt;那樣散發著靈性的紫光，也不像粉水晶那樣帶著甜蜜的粉紅——黑碧璽是徹底的黑，深沉、不透光、毫不張揚。但正是這份沉穩的黑，讓它成為水晶療癒領域中最被信賴的防護石。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>風象星座能量解析：雙子天秤水瓶的風之性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;風有很多種吹拂的方式——有的是春天的穿堂風，在每扇窗之間穿梭，帶來各個房間的消息；有的是傍晚的微風，溫柔地拂過水面，讓一切歸於和諧的漣漪；有的是高空的氣流，看不見摸不著，卻悄悄改變了整片天空的走向。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>12星座守護石對照表（2026）：生日／幸運水晶一次查</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%B0%8D%E7%85%A7%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E7%9F%B3/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%B0%8D%E7%85%A7%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E7%9F%B3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;12 星座守護石是什麼？這是一份按星座整理主石與輔助石的文化象徵對照表。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>水象星座能量解析：巨蟹天蠍雙魚的深海性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E6%B5%B7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E6%B5%B7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水有很多種存在的方式——有的是溫暖的泉眼，從地底源源不絕地湧出，滋養著身邊的每一寸土地；有的是深不見底的海溝，表面看似平靜，底下卻藏著驚人的壓力與暗流；有的是無邊際的薄霧，瀰漫在空氣中，觸碰不到卻無處不在。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>火象星座能量解析：牡羊獅子射手的火焰性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%81%AB%E7%84%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%81%AB%E7%84%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;火焰有很多種燃燒的方式——有的像剛擦亮的火柴，瞬間點燃整片黑暗；有的像壁爐裡的炭火，持續散發溫暖的光芒；有的像營火的火星，隨風飄散到意想不到的遠方。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>牡羊座守護水晶完整指南：海藍寶與紅碧玉的能量搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7%E8%97%8D%E5%AF%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B4%85%E7%A2%A7%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7%E8%97%8D%E5%AF%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B4%85%E7%A2%A7%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;牡羊座的能量像一把剛點燃的火焰——燃燒得又快又烈，照亮了整個房間，卻也偶爾不小心燙到身邊的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>處女座守護石是什麼？粉水晶與藍紋瑪瑙怎麼選</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B2%89%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E8%97%8D%E7%B4%8B%E7%91%AA%E7%91%99%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B2%89%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E8%97%8D%E7%B4%8B%E7%91%AA%E7%91%99%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;處女座守護石是什麼？本站以粉水晶為主石，藍紋瑪瑙為輔助石；配對是文化象徵。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>土象星座能量解析：金牛處女摩羯的大地性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大地有很多種存在的方式——有的是春天的沃土，溫暖而肥沃，萬物都想在這裡扎根；有的是精心打理的花園，每一寸都被仔細安排，沒有一片葉子是多餘的；有的是高聳入雲的山岩，歷經風霜卻紋風不動，頂端的風景只屬於願意攀登的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶 x 眉心輪 &amp; 頂輪：一顆石頭，同時打開兩個靈性能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大多數水晶只對應一個脈輪。紫水晶不一樣——它同時連結眉心輪和頂輪，也就是七脈輪體系裡最頂端的兩個能量中心。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶功效：左右手、愛情、五行與助眠說法整理</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在水晶店走了一圈，最後手裡還是捧著一顆紫水晶——你不孤單，幾乎每個人的起點都在這裡。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶怎麼用？冥想、助眠、空間淨化實戰完整指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;買了紫水晶，然後呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶星座配對：雙魚、水瓶、射手為什麼特別有緣？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%85%8D%E5%B0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%89%B9%E5%88%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%B7%A3/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%85%8D%E5%B0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%89%B9%E5%88%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%B7%A3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;同樣一顆紫水晶，有人戴了感覺渾身舒暢，有人帶了幾個月幾乎沒感覺。這不全然是「信不信的問題」——星座跟水晶的共振確實有差。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶淨化方法完整指南：月光浴、煙燻、聲音療癒怎麼選？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E6%B5%B4%E7%85%99%E7%87%BB%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E6%B5%B4%E7%85%99%E7%87%BB%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶需要淨化——這件事很多人知道，但真正做到的不多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>